clueweb09-en0007-09-20887.120 bar kurrajong nsw] Hawkesbury Restaurants, Bars & Pubs Hawkesbury Restaurants & Bars Hawkesbury Pubs Dining in the Hawkesbury is a pleasurable experience as our many restaurants specialise in fine cuisine to enliven your taste buds. We cater for all our visitors ranging from 5 star dining to the more casual ‘easy on the pocket’ dining. We have a variety of A la Carte dining, as well as Specialist and International restaurants such as Seafood, Italian, Indian, Thai, Chinese, Steak and Pasta, Pizzas, Wine Bars and Bistros, Hotel Dining, Local Club Dining, Cafes, Coffee Shops, or if you like to eat on the move, try our Horse Drawn Restaurants where you can enjoy your meals and experience Hawkesbury’s heritage as you meander through our wonderful vistas. Bon Appetit! Listed below are some of our dining venues...for link to Hawkesbury Dining Guide Website scroll to bottom of page. Restaurants & Bars in
